receive 7
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen a)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen a \*)] permanent flags
* OK [HIGHESTMODSEQ 36] next modseq - 1
